192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 329 0 R
/E (Shocks are observed due to the greensheild relation which says velocity of crowd will be inversly proportional to density. \(High density crowd ahead will move slower than low density crowd behind\). However the shpae of the shock is still a topic of discussion.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
